WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Shelf space is earned in the details.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:10.300
Carve brings the readiness factors buyers evaluate into one focused assessment.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:16.600
Then it shows the one thing most likely to delay your next purchase order.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:27.400
In this illustrative example, that is fulfillment readiness.
Validate production timing and capacity, then decide what to do next.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.300
Ask Carve to explain the facts behind the recommendation.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:41.700
When you are ready, review buyer-ready drafts built from your saved information.
You stay in control.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.250
One assessment. One blocker.
A clearer route to your next purchase order.
